+| fraction part as f + delta, where 1 < f < 2^25, and 0 <= delta <= 2.
+| If delta < 1, do nothing. If delta > 1, add 1 to f.
+| If delta == 1, we make sure the rounded number will be even (odd?)
+| (after shifting).
